    "content": "\"For Christ, our Passover lamb, has been sacrificed\" ({{1Cor 5:7}}). Jesus died on the day of Passover, at the same time the lambs were being slaughtered in the temple. His blood is \"applied to the doorposts\" of our hearts and saves us from eternal judgment."
